    "sentence_translations": [
      "",
      "Li Han said, “Then you should go and see her now!”",
      "",
      "“She is currently not at home. Tomorrow at 9 o’clock I will go to the train station to see her.",
      "We will take a taxi together to the movie theater, she and her mom will watch a movie there.”",
      "",
      "Li Han thought for a moment and said, “The train station to the movie theater won’t take very long by car.”",
      "",
      "“I know. The train station to the movie theater is just 7–8 minutes.” Li Fei looked at Li Han and said, ..",
      ".. “Dad, tell me, will I have time to tell her I love her? No I won’t!",
      "Dad, all your money can’t buy one minute of her time.”",
      "",
      "“Alright, Little Fei!” Li Han saw that Li Fei was unhappy and said, “Don’t think about this, why don’t you go out?",
